":null,"time":{"label":"建安二年正月以前","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhuge-e-p001a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhuge-e-p001a-q","source_order":[35,24,"P001a"],"order":6752},{"id":"zhuge-e-p001b","title":"西城民反杀诸葛玄送首刘繇","accounts":[{"id":"zhuge-e-p001b-account","label":"《献帝春秋》","text":"西城民反杀诸葛玄送首刘繇","evidence":["zhuge-e-p001b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhuge-p0003","role":"被杀","evidence":["zhuge-e-p001b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"建安二年正月以前","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhuge-e-p001b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhuge-e-p001b-q","source_order":[35,24,"P001b"],"order":6753}],"persons":[{"id":"zhuge-p0003","name":"诸葛玄","evidence":["zhuge-q-o002","yaoci-q-6798b4c99d7c926c6eca"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhuge-m-o002-zhuge-p0003","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhuge-q-o002"]},{"id":"zhuge-m-o003-zhuge-p0003","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhuge-q-o003"]},{"id":"zhuge-m-p001-zhuge-p0003","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhuge-q-p001"]},{"id":"zhuge-m-o075-zhuge-p0003","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhuge-q-o075"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yaoci-q-6798b4c99d7c926c6eca","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-0352ce76d13020899e82","layer":"pei","quote":"是岁，繇屯彭泽。又使融助皓，讨刘表所用太守诸葛玄","attribution":"裴注·献帝春秋","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f1c4a2446f35552ad79a","start":12,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-o002a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-501565c8252ddb7ebc4f","layer":"original","quote":"亮早孤〖2〗。从父玄，为袁术所署豫章太守〖3〗，玄将亮及亮弟均之官〖4〗。会汉朝更选朱皓代玄；玄素与荆州牧刘表有旧，往依之。﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-o003a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-666f71355a6c154555a1","layer":"original","quote":"玄卒，亮躬耕陇亩〖5〗。好为《梁父吟》〖6〗，","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-p001a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-0ba957ed490b6345b7bd","layer":"pei","quote":"初，豫章太守周术病卒，刘表上诸葛玄为豫章太守，治南昌。汉朝闻周术死，遣朱皓代玄。皓从扬州刺史刘繇求兵，击玄；玄退屯西城：皓入南昌。","attribution":"《献帝春秋》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":23,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-43698058f80b13e4af1b","start":12,"end":77,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-p001b-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-0ba957ed490b6345b7bd","layer":"pei","quote":"建安二年正月，西城民反，杀玄，送首诣繇。","attribution":"《献帝春秋》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":23,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-43698058f80b13e4af1b","start":77,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o002","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-501565c8252ddb7ebc4f","layer":"original","quote":"亮早孤〖2〗。从父玄，为袁术所署豫章太守〖3〗，玄将亮及亮弟均之官〖4〗。会汉朝更选朱皓代玄；玄素与荆州牧刘表有旧，往依之。﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o003","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-666f71355a6c154555a1","layer":"original","quote":"玄卒，亮躬耕陇亩〖5〗。好为《梁父吟》〖6〗，﹝二﹞身长八尺〖7〗，每自比于管仲、乐毅〖8〗。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o075","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-7884de70f24ab42e3178","layer":"original","quote":"亮少有逸群之才〖7〗，英霸之器〖8〗；身长八尺，容貌甚伟：时人异焉。遭汉末扰乱，随叔父玄避难荆州；躬耕于野，不求闻达。时左将军刘备以亮有殊量〖9〗，乃三顾亮于草庐之中；亮深谓备雄姿杰出，遂解带写诚〖10〗，厚相结纳。及魏武帝南征荆州，刘琮举州委质；而备失势众寡〖11〗，无立锥之地。亮时年二十七，乃建奇策；身使孙权〖12〗，求援吴、会。权既宿服仰备〖13〗，又睹亮奇雅，甚敬重之；即遣兵三万人以助备，备得用与武帝交战，大破其军；乘胜克捷，江南悉平。后备又西取益州；益州既定，以亮为军师将军。备称尊号，拜亮为丞相，录尚书事。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":346,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":261,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-p001","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-0ba957ed490b6345b7bd","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《献帝春秋》曰：“初，豫章太守周术病卒，刘表上诸葛玄为豫章太守，治南昌。汉朝闻周术死，遣朱皓代玄。皓从扬州刺史刘繇求兵，击玄；玄退屯西城：皓入南昌。建安二年正月，西城民反，杀玄，送首诣繇。”此书所云，与本传不同。","attribution":"《献帝春秋》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":23,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-43698058f80b13e4af1b","start":0,"end":109,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
